---
#3959, track §11 and §14.1 `bynk.given.kind_needs_parameter`: a commons never names an
instantiable kind bare, so a library never silently means "the caller's default instance".
---
commons lib.cache

consumes bynk.cloudflare { Kv }

fn forget(key: String) -> Effect[()] given Kv {
	Kv.delete(key)
}
